   "beats": [
    "say: Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.",
    "say: 🕯️ Lily is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes.",
    "say: Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.",
    "say: Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.",
    "say: Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it.",
    "say: 🕯️ Lily Duarte is dead — combat. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
    "say: \"Lily's gone.\" Jesse looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Lily.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face.",
    "say: The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Nino blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.",
    "say: 🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\"",
    "say: 📖 The Codex turns a page: Lily Duarte, 60 days. The mantle passes to Nino Kapanadze.",
    "say: 🪞 You wake up somebody else. Nino Kapanadze, 56 — a dry cleaner.",
    "say: At the grave, Jesse speaks for Nino — \"Lily trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
   ],
